<span id="S3.T1.5.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">VQA-RAD, PMC-VQA, PATH-VQA, SLAKE, MIMIC-CXR-VQA, VQA-Med-2019</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.5.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
