<span id="S3.T1.5.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:284.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.5.1.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">AlpaCare, ApolloCorpus, MedQuAD, MedQA, PMC-LLaMA</span>
</span></td></tr>
